# PART 5: REHEARSAL SCHEDULING

This system must support flexible rehearsal schedules.

Our activities can change because of Mass, church programmes, robe preparation, town sanitation and transport restrictions.

Establish the following default timetable:

| Activity | Default required arrival |
|---|---|
| Friday rehearsal | 6:30 PM |
| Saturday rehearsal | 8:30 AM |
| Sunday pre-Mass gathering | 7:30 AM |
| Sunday post-Mass rehearsal | Manually configured |

Friday rehearsal usually starts around 7:00 PM because Mass may continue until approximately 6:45 PM.

Sunday pre-Mass arrival time can change depending on robe preparation.

Sunday post-Mass rehearsal usually falls around 11:00 AM–12:30 PM, but must be configurable for each date.

## Individual session settings

Each rehearsal must have:

- Session ID.
- Activity type.
- Date.
- Required arrival time.
- Actual rehearsal start time.
